{"sha": "bda61c726c278c9a08e846c8e8e6e7b2b4323339f2d46d738b753dbfc33ecc6b", "body": ["\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{MOdiagram}[names, labels, style=square, distance=4.2cm, labels-fs=\\scriptsize]", "  \\atom[N]{left}{ 2s = {0;pair}, 2p = {3.5;up,up,up} }", "  \\atom[N]{right}{ 2s = {0;pair}, 2p = {3.5;up,up,up} }", "  \\molecule[\\ce{N2}]{ 2sMO = {.7;pair,pair}, 2pMO = {0.4/2.5,1.4;pair,pair,pair} }", "\\end{MOdiagram}", "\\hfill", "\\begin{MOdiagram}[names, labels, style=square, distance=4.2cm, labels-fs=\\scriptsize]", "  \\atom[O]{left}{ 2s = {0;pair}, 2p = {3.5;pair,up,up} }", "  \\atom[O]{right}{ 2s = {0;pair}, 2p = {3.5;pair,up,up} }", "  \\molecule[\\ce{O2}]{ 2sMO = {.7;pair,pair}, 2pMO = {1.8,.8;pair,pair,pair,up,up} }", "\\end{MOdiagram}", "", "{\\small 价层分子轨道图：\\ce{N2}（左，含 s--p 混杂，", "$\\sigma_{2p}$ 位于 $\\pi_{2p}$ 之上）与 \\ce{O2}（右）。氮：键级", "$(8 - 2)/2 = 3$，所有电子均已成对。氧：键级 $(8 - 4)/2 = 2$，", "两个 $\\pi^*$ 轨道各有一个未成对电子（洪特规则）：\\ce{O2} 为", "顺磁性物质。图中取 $x$ 为分子轴，故标记为", "$2\\sigma_x$、$2\\pi_y$、$2\\pi_z$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{method}[构造并填充分子轨道图]\\label{met:b2:diatomic-mos:build-diagram}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 将各原子的价层原子轨道按其能量放置，", "        电负性较大的原子的轨道取较低位置。", "  \\item 将对称性相同的轨道两两组合：每一对给出位于下方的一个成键轨道，", "        与位于上方的一个反键轨道；无配对的轨道", "        保持为非键轨道。", "  \\item 对第二周期同核双原子分子，采用 $\\sigma_{2p}$ 位于", "        $\\pi_{2p}$ 之上的次序，直至氮为止；自氧起则反过来。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{method}[读懂已填充的图]\\label{met:b2:diatomic-mos:fill}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 数出价电子数（每个负电荷加 1，", "        每个正电荷减 1）。", "  \\item 自下而上填充，每个轨道至多 2 个电子；简并能级", "        按洪特规则依次占据。", "  \\item 键级为 $(n_b - n_a)/2$；存在未成对电子即呈顺磁性。", "  \\item 最先被电离的是被占据的最高能级。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\small", "\\renewcommand{\\arraystretch}{1.15}", "\\begin{tabular}{lcccccc}", " & \\ce{Li2} & \\ce{C2} & \\ce{N2} & \\ce{O2} & \\ce{F2} & \\ce{NO} \\\\ \\hline", "价电子数 & 2 & 8 & 10 & 12 & 14 & 11 \\\\", "键级 & 1 & 2 & 3 & 2 & 1 & 2.5 \\\\", "未成对电子数 & 0 & 0 & 0 & 2 & 0 & 1 \\\\", "键长 $r_e$（pm） & 267.3 & 124.3 & 109.8 & 120.8 & 141.2 & 115.1 \\\\", "$D_0$（\\unit{eV}） & 1.04 & 6.15 & 9.76 & 5.12 & 1.60 & 6.51 \\\\", "\\end{tabular}", "", "\\smallskip", "{\\small 第二周期双原子分子：键级由分子轨道图得出；键长", "由光谱测得；解离能 $D_0$ 由列表给出的生成焓求得，", "在 \\qty{0}{K} 下，$D_0 = \\Delta_f H_0(\\mathrm A) + \\Delta_f H_0(\\mathrm B) - \\Delta_f", "H_0(\\mathrm{AB})$。}", "% ledger: re:Li2, re:C2, re:N2, re:O2, re:F2, re:NO, janafH0:Li, janafH0:Li2, janafH0:C, janafH0:C2, janafH0:N, janafH0:O, janafH0:F, janafH0:NO", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\section{异核双原子分子}", "", "\\begin{theorem}[能量不同的两个轨道]\\label{thm:b2:diatomic-mos:heteronuclear}", "设 $\\alpha_A > \\alpha_B$（B 的电负性更大），略去 $S$，$\\bar\\alpha = (\\alpha_A", "+ \\alpha_B)/2$，$\\Delta = \\alpha_A - \\alpha_B$：", "\\[", "  E_\\mp = \\bar\\alpha \\mp \\sqrt{\\Delta^2/4 + \\beta^2} .", "\\]", "成键轨道（能量较低）上 B 的系数较大，反键轨道", "上 A 的系数较大；当 $\\Delta \\gg |\\beta|$ 时，$E_- \\approx \\alpha_B - \\beta^2/\\Delta$，$E_+", "\\approx \\alpha_A + \\beta^2/\\Delta$。", "\\end{theorem}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "当 $S = 0$ 时，能量即为矩阵 $\\begin{pmatrix}\\alpha_A & \\beta \\\\", "\\beta & \\alpha_B\\end{pmatrix}$ 的本征值：$(\\alpha_A - E)(\\alpha_B - E) = \\beta^2$，其根为", "$\\bar\\alpha \\pm \\sqrt{\\Delta^2/4 + \\beta^2}$。对于较低的根，$(\\alpha_B - E_-)c_B = -\\beta", "c_A$；$\\alpha_B - E_- = \\sqrt{\\Delta^2/4 + \\beta^2} - \\Delta/2$ 小于 $|\\beta|$，故", "$|c_A| < |c_B|$。对 $\\Delta \\gg |\\beta|$，$\\sqrt{\\Delta^2/4 + \\beta^2} \\approx \\Delta/2 +", "\\beta^2/\\Delta$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[width=0.55\\linewidth, height=6cm, xmin=0, xmax=8, ymin=-5, ymax=5,", "  axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left, xlabel={$\\Delta/|\\beta|$}, ylabel={$E/|\\beta|$},", "  tick label style={font=\\small}, label style={font=\\small}]", "\\addplot[omThm, thick] table[x=d, y=Ehigh] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-two-level-a.dat};", "\\addplot[omDef, thick] table[x=d, y=Elow] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-two-level-a.dat};", "\\addplot[black!50, densely dotted] table[x=d, y=aA] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-two-level-a.dat};", "\\addplot[black!50, densely dotted] table[x=d, y=aB] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-two-level-a.dat};", "\\addplot[omThm, dashed] table[x=d, y=Phigh] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-two-level-a-pert.dat};", "\\addplot[omDef, dashed] table[x=d, y=Plow] {figdata/out/bachelor-2-two-level-a-pert.dat};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, black!60, anchor=north west] at (axis cs:5.5,2.6) {$\\alpha_A$};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, black!60, anchor=south west] at (axis cs:5.5,-2.6) {$\\alpha_B$};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, omThm, anchor=south east] at (axis cs:3.2,2.2) {反键};", "\\node[font=\\scriptsize, omDef, anchor=north east] at (axis cs:3.2,-2.2) {成键};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 两个相互作用的能级。随原子轨道间的能隙 $\\Delta$ 增大，", "分子能级（实线）趋近原子能级（点线）。微扰极限（虚线）给出的稳定化", "$\\beta^2/\\Delta$ 变小。当 $\\Delta = 0$ 时，", "能级劈裂为 $2|\\beta|$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", ""]}